exists su name boundary classifier be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext text "You read the first gross chip (user content). Identify the document kind and explain how to detect section boundaries in this document type. Your output is a prompt that will be given to small LLMs to find section boundaries in each chip and return a single exact boundary marker quote. Output exactly two paragraphs: (1) Document kind and cues. (2) Boundary detection guidance with examples anchored to the chip text and a final sentence stating the required output format (single boundary marker quote only). Use short, concrete sentences. No bullet lists." ya
exists su name boundary swallower be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name boundary prompt ya

su name boundary propose be ceremony def
  su name boundary marker ob text of ob of this for name boundary swallower to name text boundary marker be write do
  su name boundary marker ret
prah

su name boundary refinery be refinery def
su name load source from filename "documentation/specifications/01-sentence-and-grammar.md" become wo text to name text source be read do
su name gross chip from name text source atmost byte 360 to name text gross chips be gross chip do
su name show chip ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of gross chips be write do
su name classify prompt ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of gross chips for name boundary classifier to name text boundary prompt be write do
su name show prompt ob text of ob of boundary prompt be write do
